<title>GREECE: NEW GREEK REGISTRATIONS FOR VEHICLES IN OCTOBER.</title>
<headline>NEW GREEK REGISTRATIONS FOR VEHICLES IN OCTOBER.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of new registration permits for vehicles in Greece in October was 16,673, the National Statistics Service said.</p>
<p>Of the 16,673 vehicles, 20.9 percent (3,491 vehicles) were used. The corresponding figures for 1995 were 18,250 and 4,444, respectively. --Margarita Sotiropoulou, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
